(5769290, 839983, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you must be getting killed on this one - I''m guessing this is the <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=102278" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">clive_patric_nolan</a> entry?<br/> <br/>I''m a fan but I must admit there''s not too much for me to hang onto here. I don''t really get the angle - am I missing some cultural context?<br/> <br/>In terms of enjoying the image - the light is intriguing and the focal point is eclectic but for me the image doesn''t ''hang together'' - it is in dissonance.<br/> <br/>On a positive note - I think the contrast and the colouring with the little bit of red at the top is excellent.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 5 earlier, coming back to comment. This longer look hasn''t offered up any reason to change the score.<br/> <br/>I''m pleased to have viewed it though - a nice contrast to the other entries.</td>', 'I''m sure you must be getting killed on this one - I''m guessing this is the  clive_patric_nolan entry? I''m a fan but I must admit there''s not too much for me to hang onto here. I don''t really get the angle - am I missing some cultural context? In terms of enjoying the image - the light is intriguing and the focal point is eclectic but for me the image doesn''t ''hang together'' - it is in dissonance. On a positive note - I think the contrast and the colouring with the little bit of red at the top is excellent. Gave it a 5 earlier, coming back to comment. This longer look hasn''t offered up any reason to change the score. I''m pleased to have viewed it though - a nice contrast to the other entries.', '2009-12-16 13:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
