(5770403, 840034, 112828, '<td valign="top">At the risk of being beaten senseless by a mob of my fellows..  I''ve just never "gotten" it with the whole ''cute baby'' thing.  Personally I just think they''re a bit creepy looking.  Yep, I said it... The only cute baby is your baby...  Poor things look like a Devon Rex..<br/> <br/>Sigh.. Still a good photo overall, not that it particularly relates to the challenge.. But, I guess bored was a pretty broad subject when interpreted, as it could also apply to what''s behind the lens.  So, S:6.  Merry Christmas :).r</td>', 'At the risk of being beaten senseless by a mob of my fellows..  I''ve just never "gotten" it with the whole ''cute baby'' thing.  Personally I just think they''re a bit creepy looking.  Yep, I said it... The only cute baby is your baby...  Poor things look like a Devon Rex.. Sigh.. Still a good photo overall, not that it particularly relates to the challenge.. But, I guess bored was a pretty broad subject when interpreted, as it could also apply to what''s behind the lens.  So, S:6.  Merry Christmas :).r', '2009-12-17 14:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
