(5773437, 839585, 54645, '<td valign="top">Great implied environmental portrait, i.e. vibrant teenager being held back by the small, nothing to do, stereotyped town. The presence of the lock in the frame was a great choice. Keep those teenage boys locked up in that town! I have daughters to raise in the big suburb sprawl of SoCal! ;) I do think that the image is too dark overall, other than that I like it, and it''s connection to the challenge has grown on me over the course of the week. 6 because it''s just a bit too dark.</td>', 'Great implied environmental portrait, i.e. vibrant teenager being held back by the small, nothing to do, stereotyped town. The presence of the lock in the frame was a great choice. Keep those teenage boys locked up in that town! I have daughters to raise in the big suburb sprawl of SoCal! ;) I do think that the image is too dark overall, other than that I like it, and it''s connection to the challenge has grown on me over the course of the week. 6 because it''s just a bit too dark.', '2009-12-20 18:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773440, 839982, 54645, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of field with the soft gait. He is free to go, but does not seem to the path to joy and happiness. Haunted by the broken family, one of whom is behind those bright windows. 9</td>', 'I like the depth of field with the soft gait. He is free to go, but does not seem to the path to joy and happiness. Haunted by the broken family, one of whom is behind those bright windows. 9', '2009-12-20 19:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
