(5778415, 838661, 53814, '<td valign="top">The faded nail polish and mattress rip/stain are great descriptors, along with the tacky colors and well-used furniture. The necklace, especially, and to some degree, the wristband, are too literal for me and detract from the realism. Maybe a single-strand gold chain with a cross. <br/>Overall, this is excellent. -10</td>', 'The faded nail polish and mattress rip/stain are great descriptors, along with the tacky colors and well-used furniture. The necklace, especially, and to some degree, the wristband, are too literal for me and detract from the realism. Maybe a single-strand gold chain with a cross. Overall, this is excellent. -10', '2009-12-22 22:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
