(5800198, 840076, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a great photo, Jennifer!  I agree:  housework is the most boring work on the planet.  A friend of mine decided to start a house cleaning business -- so the only right thing to do was give her some business to get her started.  It was the first time ever that I paid to have my house cleaned -- but now -- shoot -- I''d pay triple and think it was the best money I ever spent :)   Your mom played the part so well, and I bet she is looking radiant over your blue ribbon :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'What a great photo, Jennifer!  I agree:  housework is the most boring work on the planet.  A friend of mine decided to start a house cleaning business -- so the only right thing to do was give her some business to get her started.  It was the first time ever that I paid to have my house cleaned -- but now -- shoot -- I''d pay triple and think it was the best money I ever spent :)   Your mom played the part so well, and I bet she is looking radiant over your blue ribbon :) ', '2010-01-07 08:31:15.000000', NULL, 0),
